    <string name="instructions_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="instructions_body">Fill the 9×9 grid with digits 1 through 9.\n\n• Each row, column, and 3×3 box must contain every digit exactly once.\n\n• Tap an empty cell and pick a number from the keypad below.\n\n• Use Notes to pencil in candidates.\n\n• Choose difficulty (Easy, Medium, Hard) and tap Reset for a new puzzle.\n\n• Open statistics, settings, and language from the top icons.</string>
